# Deliberately minimal. The stack is not chosen yet (docs/requirements.md), so this file
# covers only what is certain: secrets, OS noise and editor noise. Add stack specific
# entries when a stack is actually decided, not before.

# Local working context, deliberately untracked. Holds machine specific environment
# details and personal notes that have no place in a public repository. The engineering
# invariants that contributors actually need are stated in README.md instead.
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md

# Secrets and local configuration. NFR-S3: no secret is ever committed.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
secrets/

# OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*~

# Editor and tooling
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# Logs and local scratch
*.log
tmp/
.cache/
